#: src/renderer/src/components/help/UserManual.tsx
msgid "To make one, unlock Setup mode, set the faders to the look you want, press the <0>Add scene</0> button after the scenes, name it and choose its fixtures: their current values are stored. The edit button next to a scene renames it, gives it a color (a dot on its button) or changes its fixtures; check <1>Save current values</1> to store what the faders show now. Deleting a fixture takes it out of every scene."
msgstr "To make one, unlock Setup mode, set the faders to the look you want, press the <0>Add scene</0> button after the scenes, name it and choose its fixtures: their current values are stored. The edit button next to a scene renames it, gives it a color (a dot on its button) or changes its fixtures; check <1>Save current values</1> to store what the faders show now. Deleting a fixture takes it out of every scene."

