#: src/renderer/src/components/fixtures/SceneHelp.tsx
msgid "When editing, renaming the scene or ticking and unticking fixtures doesn't change the values already stored: only a newly ticked fixture is stored with what its faders show now. <0>Save current values</0> stores what the faders show now for every ticked fixture, replacing the stored values. To change a scene's look, press the scene, adjust the faders, then save it with Save current values."
msgstr "When editing, renaming the scene or ticking and unticking fixtures doesn't change the values already stored: only a newly ticked fixture is stored with what its faders show now. <0>Save current values</0> stores what the faders show now for every ticked fixture, replacing the stored values. To change a scene's look, press the scene, adjust the faders, then save it with Save current values."

