msgid "Without a project, the <0>Show</0> view offers <1>Create project</1> and <2>Open project</2>; later they are in the <3>Project</3> section of the <4>Settings</4> view, with the recent projects. Creating a project needs Setup mode (in Show mode, the password is asked first), opening one doesn't. A double-click on a .glp file opens it in the app, also while the app is running. The app opens the last project again on its next start."
msgstr "Without a project, the <0>Show</0> view offers <1>Create project</1> and <2>Open project</2>; later they are in the <3>Project</3> section of the <4>Settings</4> view, with the recent projects. Creating a project needs Setup mode (in Show mode, the password is asked first), opening one doesn't. A double-click on a .glp file opens it in the app, also while the app is running. The app opens the last project again on its next start."

